IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. BRANCH.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 CODE PIC X VALUE "A".
 88 ACTIVE VALUE "A".
01 RESULT PIC 9 VALUE 0.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
IF ACTIVE
 IF CODE = "A" MOVE 1 TO RESULT ELSE MOVE 2 TO RESULT END-IF
ELSE MOVE 3 TO RESULT END-IF
EVALUATE TRUE
 WHEN RESULT = 1 DISPLAY "one"
 WHEN RESULT = 2 DISPLAY "two"
 WHEN OTHER DISPLAY "other"
END-EVALUATE
SET ACTIVE TO TRUE
GOBACK.
